y":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Just so this doesn't get lost.\r\n\r\n```php\r\nclass SomeIterator {}\r\nneeds(new SomeIterator);\r\n/** @psalm-suppress InvalidClass **/\r\nfunction needs(someiterator $x) : void {}\r\n```\r\n```\r\n$ for locale in C tr_TR.UTF-8 tr_TR.iso88599; do echo \"$locale:\"; LC_ALL=$locale psalm qq.php; done\r\nC:\r\nChecks took 0.071636199951172 and used 16.211MB\r\ntr_TR.UTF-8:\r\nERROR: InvalidArgument - qq.php:4:7 - Argument 1 of needs expects someiterator, SomeIterator provided\r\nneeds(new SomeIterator);\r\n\r\n\r\nERROR: UndefinedClass - qq.php:6:16 - Class or interface someiterator does not exist\r\nfunction needs(someiterator $x) : void {}\r\n\r\n\r\nChecks took 0.048421144485474 and used 14.227MB\r\ntr_TR.iso88599:\r\nERROR: InvalidArgument - qq.php:4:7 - Argument 1 of needs expects someiterator, SomeIterator provided\r\nneeds(new SomeIterator);\r\n\r\n\r\nERROR: UndefinedClass - qq.php:6:16 - Class or interface someiterator does not exist\r\nfunction needs(someiterator $x) : void {}\r\n\r\n\r\nChecks took 0.048002004623413 and used 14.227MB\r\n```\r\nThe reason for this bug (and similar) is pervasive usage of `strtolower()` across the codebase, where other approaches like `strcasecmp()` could have been used.\r\n\r\nAlso see discussion in this commit: d455e249586b462c0488a59a926ef3909daa67da","closed_by":{"login":"muglug","id":2292638,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyOTI2Mzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2292638?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug","html_url":"https://github.com/muglug","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/subscriptions","organ